  "id": "modul-16-adjacency-list",
  "title": "Lengkapi Pembuatan Adjacency List",
  "description": "Graf tak berarah punya n simpul bernomor 0 sampai n-1; edges berisi pasangan [u, v]. solve(n, edges) mengembalikan adjacency list: array berukuran n, tiap elemen berisi tetangga simpul itu, terurut naik. Lengkapi bagian TODO: untuk setiap sisi, masukkan v ke daftar u dan u ke daftar v.\nContoh: solve(3, [[0, 1], [1, 2]]) mengembalikan [[1], [0, 2], [1]].",
  "starterCode": "function solve(n, edges) {\n  const adj = Array.from({ length: n }, () => [])\n  for (const [u, v] of edges) {\n    // TODO: tambahkan v ke adj[u] dan u ke adj[v] (graf\n    //   tak berarah)\n  }\n  return adj.map((a) => a.sort((p, q) => p - q))\n}\n",
  "solution": "function solve(n, edges) {\n  const adj = Array.from({ length: n }, () => [])\n  for (const [u, v] of edges) {\n    adj[u].push(v)\n    adj[v].push(u)\n  }\n  return adj.map((a) => a.sort((p, q) => p - q))\n}\n",
